        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued September 30 at 3:43AM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL",
        "description": "Areas of dense fog development is expected from the I-10 corridor\nnorthward across Southeast Georgia early this morning. Visibility\nas low as 1/4 mile or less can be expected at times through\nsunrise. Dense fog advisories may need to be posted for areas of\ninland Southeast Georgia along the Altamaha River Basin.\nConditions should improve between 8 am and 9 am this morning.\n\nThe nature of the fog is such that visibilities will vary greatly\nover short distances. Motorists should be alert for rapidly\nchanging conditions through sunrise. If driving, slow down and\nleave extra distance ahead of you in case a sudden stop is needed.",
